msgid "Activate or deactivate Redis Clients"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When a Redis Clients is configured at build time, and its URL is set at "
"runtime, it is active by default. Quarkus\n"
"starts the corresponding Redis Client when the application starts."
msgstr ""

msgid "To deactivate a Redis Client at runtime, either:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Do not set `quarkus.redis[.optional name].hosts` or `quarkus.redis[.optional "
"name].hosts-provider-name`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Set `quarkus.redis[.optional name].active` to `false`."
msgstr ""

msgid "If a Redis Client is not active:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Redis Client does not attempt to connect to Redis during application "
"startup."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Redis Client does not contribute a <<redis-health-check,health check>>."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Static CDI injection points involving the Redis Client, such as `@Inject "
"ReactiveRedisDataSource redis` or `@Inject RedisDataSource redis`, cause "
"application startup to fail."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dynamic retrieval of the Redis Client, such as through `CDI."
"getBeanContainer()`, `Arc.instance()`, or an injected "
"`Instance<ReactiveRedisDataSource>`, causes an exception to be thrown."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Other Quarkus extensions that consume the Redis Client may cause application "
"startup to fail."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This feature is especially useful when the application must dynamically "
"select a Redis Client from a predefined set at\n"
"runtime."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Setting `quarkus.redis.one.active=true` xref:config-reference."
"adoc#configuration-sources[at runtime] makes only the\n"
"Redis Client `one` available.\n"
"Setting `quarkus.redis.two.active=true` at runtime makes only the Redis "
"Client `two` available."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A Redis Client (either default or named) must always be discoverable at "
"build-time to be considered for runtime\n"
"injection. This can be done by injecting the Redis Client name with "
"`@RedisClientName`. If the Redis Client name may be\n"
"active or inactive, it needs to use the wrapper `InjectableInstance<>`, or "
"else Quarkus will throw an exception at\n"
"startup time if the Redis Client is inactive. Alternatively, Redis Clients "
"may also be discovered via configuration."
msgstr ""

