msgid ""
"When the connection pool is depleted, attempts to obtain a connection are "
"put into a queue.\n"
"By default, maximum number of attempts waiting in the queue to obtain a "
"Redis connection is 24.\n"
"This can be configured using `quarkus.redis.max-pool-waiting`."
